  "instructions": "### From workspace base\n\nWrite as the brand: warm and direct.\n\n### From workspace:platforms/instagram\n\nSound like a person, not a brochure.\n\nLead with a hook in the first line.\n\n### From page\n\nWrite the weekly tip post.",
